# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# The curated content repository.
#
# It is its own Git repository (dossiers, terms, ranking boards) and is cloned
# beside COKEY rather than vendored into it, so content can be reviewed and
# reverted on its own history. COKEY reads it at runtime and falls back to the
# catalog compiled into this build when it is absent. Anchored to the root on
# purpose: `src/core/cms` is this project's own code for reading it.
/cms/

# Test / coverage
coverage/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
